Error: Jet.MutableNeverReassigned: `names` never changes, so drop its `^`
  --> Tests/UI/E0514_never_written_is_an_error.jet:13:6
    |
 13 |     ^names: [String]{"a"}
    |      ^^^^^
 Why: `^` tells the reader the value changes later, but nothing in its scope writes it
 Fix: Write `names: …` instead of `^names: …`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/Jet.MutableNeverReassigned

